      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01323",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "\"不过，每天都来，不会挨老师的骂吗？\"鞠子说。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"But if you come every day, won't your teacher scold you?\" Mariko said.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01323",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "她看到被看出了的我露出了惊慌的神色，接着又说道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Seeing that I looked flustered after being seen through, she went on:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01323",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "\"我明白了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"I understand now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01323",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "现在净是剃背头的，理平头的肯定是和尚。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "These days everyone has the back of their head shaved, so anyone with a crew cut must be a monk.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01323",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "据说，如今成了名僧的那些先生，他们年轻时大都光顾过这里……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "They say that many of those gentlemen who are famous monks now used to come here often when they were young...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01323",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "来！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Come on!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01323",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "咱们唱歌吧！\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Let's sing!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
